OL,3,A'I don't know what my partner earns':
OL,4,AHow soon into dating should you reveal
OL,5,Ayour salary?
OL,6,
OL,7,FYou know their favourite restaurant,
OL,8,Fwhat happened with their ex and their
OL,9,Fmost embarrassing childhood story. But
OL,10,Fdo you know how much your partner
OL,11,Fearns?
OL,13,FMoney remains one of dating's trickier
OL,14,Fconversations. Bring it up too early
OL,15,Fand it can sound like you're sizing up
OL,16,Ftheir bank balance. But leave it too
OL,17,Flong and you could be planning a future
OL,18,Fwith someone without knowing much about
OL,19,Ftheir finances at all.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
