OL,3,A'I don't know what my partner earns':
OL,4,AHow soon into dating should you reveal
OL,5,Ayour salary?
OL,6,
OL,7,FWe spoke to 20-somethings in New York
OL,8,FCity to see if there was a sweet spot
OL,9,Ffor when to talk salaries.
OL,11,FWilla Morton, 25, says she doesn't
OL,12,Fthink couples necessarily need to
OL,13,Freveal their salaries at all.
